stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested
    Requested --> Rejected: Invalid owner input
    Requested --> All: Omit owner
    Requested --> Unassigned: Explicit null
    Requested --> Owned: Exact recorded slug
    All --> Selected: Existing eligibility
    Unassigned --> Selected: Existing eligibility and null owner_id
    Owned --> Selected: Existing eligibility and joined slug equality
    Selected --> Refused: More than 1000 rows
    Selected --> Returned: At most 1000 rows in due order
    Rejected --> [*]
    Refused --> [*]
    Returned --> [*]
